# `MEOWO_JAVA` deliberately is **not** set here.
# This file is sourced by `scripts/start-server.sh`, and a value assigned here would *shadow*
# the environment variable of the same name — so a machine-specific path written into it
# would quietly override the one the operator chose. Set `MEOWO_JAVA=/path/to/java` in the
# environment instead; the script falls back to `java` on `PATH` when it is not set.
